    {
      "id": "b2-ch2",
      "title": "Hypotheticals and the Passive",
      "subtitle": "Второй и третий условный тип и страдательный залог",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "b2-ch2-l1",
          "title": "If Only... Conditionals",
          "summary": "Учимся говорить о нереальных ситуациях во втором и третьем условном типе.",
          "estimatedMinutes": 11,
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex1",
              "type": "info",
              "title": "Second Conditional",
              "explanation": "Второй тип условия (нереальное настоящее или будущее): If + Past Simple, ... would + инфинитив. Описывает воображаемые, маловероятные ситуации. С глаголом to be часто используют were для всех лиц: if I were you.",
              "difficulty": 1,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex2",
              "type": "flashcard",
              "prompt": "If I were you",
              "translation": "На твоём месте (если бы я был тобой)",
              "example": "If I were you, I would apologize to her.",
              "difficulty": 1,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex3",
              "type": "multiple_choice",
              "prompt": "If I ___ you, I would take the job.",
              "options": [
                "were",
                "am",
                "will be"
              ],
              "correctOption": "were",
              "explanation": "Во втором условном с to be используется were для всех лиц.",
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex4",
              "type": "translate",
              "prompt": "Если бы у меня было больше денег, я бы купил новую машину.",
              "canonicalAnswer": "If I had more money, I would buy a new car.",
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "If I had more money, I'd buy a new car.",
                "If I had more money, I would get a new car."
              ],
              "hint": "If + Past Simple, ... would + инфинитив",
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex5",
              "type": "word_order",
              "prompt": "Я бы позвонил тебе, если бы мог.",
              "canonicalAnswer": "I would call you if I could.",
              "tokens": [
                "you",
                "would",
                "I",
                "if",
                "call",
                "could",
                "I",
                "."
              ],
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex6",
              "type": "info",
              "title": "Third Conditional",
              "explanation": "Третий тип условия (нереальное прошлое): If + Past Perfect, ... would have + причастие (V3). Описывает то, что не случилось в прошлом, и его воображаемый результат.",
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex7",
              "type": "flashcard",
              "prompt": "I would have helped",
              "translation": "Я бы помог",
              "example": "I would have helped if you had asked me.",
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional",
                "b2-third-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex8",
              "type": "multiple_choice",
              "prompt": "If she had studied harder, she ___ the exam.",
              "options": [
                "would have passed",
                "would pass",
                "passed"
              ],
              "correctOption": "would have passed",
              "explanation": "Третий условный: would have + причастие для нереального прошлого.",
              "difficulty": 3,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional",
                "b2-third-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex9",
              "type": "translate",
              "prompt": "Если бы ты мне сказал, я бы помог.",
              "canonicalAnswer": "If you had told me, I would have helped.",
              "acceptedAnswers": [
                "If you had told me, I'd have helped.",
                "If you had told me, I would have helped you."
              ],
              "hint": "If + Past Perfect, ... would have + V3",
              "difficulty": 3,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional",
                "b2-third-conditional"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b2-ch2-l1-ex10",
              "type": "word_order",
              "prompt": "Она бы выиграла гонку.",
              "canonicalAnswer": "She would have won the race.",
              "tokens": [
                "have",
                "would",
                "race",
                "She",
                "won",
                "the",
                "."
              ],
              "difficulty": 3,
              "topics": [
                "b2-second-conditional",
                "b2-third-conditional"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
